    "path": "/longContentPages/0",
    "raw": "Welcome customer to the 3rd edition brochure of [REDACTED]'s medical station technologies, detailing all the possible ^orange;Enhancements^reset; that our medical personnel can bestow upon you.\nAs our staff will confirm, all procedures and fees are final, refunds are not available. For your safety, these modifications will not persist through a respawn chamber. Our available benefits are as follows:\n\n^red;Berserker Rage^reset;: ^green;25% More^reset; Power, Increased Movement Speed. -^red;50^reset;% Knockback Resistance, -^red;35^reset; Protection.\n\n^gray;Glass Cannon^reset;: ^green;100% More^reset; Damage at the cost of ^red;90% Less^reset; Protection\n\n^green;Immunization^reset;: Provides ^cyan;immunity^reset; to most negative status effects. ^red;10% Less^reset; Power and Protection.\n\n^white;Juggernaut^reset;: You become ^cyan;immune^reset; to knockback and gain ^green;50^reset; protection, but your movement speed is reduced by ^red;33%^reset;.\n\n^green;Toxic Cloud^reset;: Every 3 seconds a ^green;toxic cloud^reset; that lasts 5 seconds and deals 30 piercing damage is released at your location. Every time this happens, you take ^red;5^reset; piercing damage. ^red;20^reset;% Increased Hunger Drain.\n\n^#B200FF;Experiment #322^reset;: Applies random ^green;positive^reset; and/or ^red;negative^reset; statuses every 10 seconds which last 15-25 seconds.\n\n^red;Trollblood^reset;: Regenerate ^green;40^reset;% of damage taken over 5 seconds, at the cost of ^red;20% Less^reset; HP and ^red;50^reset;% increased Energy Block Time.\n\n^green;Renergizer^reset;: ^green;50% More^reset; Energy, ^green;33% More^reset; Energy Regeneration. Hunger Drain increased by ^red;25^reset;%. ^red;100^reset;% Increased Energy Block Time.\n\n^yellow;Hypopanic^reset;: ^green;33% More^reset; Energy Regen, -^red;50^reset; Energy. In addition, Increased movement speed the less energy you have (up to +^green;67^reset;% speed at 35% energy remaining). Taking damage briefly ^red;stops^reset; energy regen, and ^red;consumes energy^reset; for 150% of damage.\n\n^green;Hivemind^reset;: While over 10% health, drains ^red;1.25^reset;% of your Maximum Health to ^green;shoot a projectile^reset; at the closest enemy, prioritizing targets not hit recently, in a medium radius with a clear line of fire every 0.5 seconds, dealing ^green;2.5^reset;% of your Max HP as base damage (^orange;affected by power multiplier^reset;) on impact and causing ^red;Beestings^reset;.\n\n^cyan;Mitochondria^reset;: Consumes ^red;2^reset; energy to regenerate ^green;1^reset; health every 0.15 seconds. Energy will regenerate only at full health.\n\n^#7A7D81;Shadow Repel^reset;: Increases shadow resistance by ^green;50^reset;% and grants ^cyan;immunity^reset; to shadow status effects, but reduces the overall effectiveness of other resistances (except physical) by ^red;33^reset;%.\n\n^#C5B00A;Radiation Repel^reset;: Increases radiation resistance by ^green;50^reset;% and grants ^cyan;immunity^reset; to radiation status effects, but reduces the overall effectiveness of other resistances (except physical) by ^red;33^reset;%.\n\n^#69B115;Poison Repel^reset;: Increases poison resistance by ^green;50^reset;% and grants ^cyan;immunity^reset; to poison status effects, but reduces the overall effectiveness of other resistances (except physical) by ^red;33^reset;%.\n\n^#A1F1FE;Ice Repel^reset;: Increases ice resistance by ^green;50^reset;% and grants ^cyan;immunity^reset; to ice status effects, but reduces the overall effectiveness of other resistances (except physical) by ^red;33^reset;%.\n\n^#E99400;Fire Repel^reset;: Increases fire resistance by ^green;50^reset;% and grants ^cyan;immunity^reset; to fire status effects, but reduces the overall effectiveness of other resistances (except physical) by ^red;33^reset;%.\n\n^#9711E4;Electrical Repel^reset;: Increases electric resistance by ^green;50^reset;% and grants ^cyan;immunity^reset; to electric status effects, but reduces the overall effectiveness of other resistances (except physical) by ^red;33^reset;%.\n\n^#6062EB;Cosmic Repel^reset;: Increases cosmic resistance by ^green;50^reset;% and grants ^cyan;immunity^reset; to cosmic status effects, but reduces the overall effectiveness of other resistances (except physical) by ^red;33^reset;%.",
    "value": "欢迎您阅览 [已编辑] 医疗站技术第三版手册，其中详述了我们医护人员可为您提供的各项^orange;增强服务^reset;。\n我们的工作人员可以证实，所有流程与费用均为最终决定，不予退款。出于安全考虑，这些改造在重生舱后不会保留。我们可提供的增益如下：\n\n^red;狂战士之怒^reset;：攻击力^green;提升25%^reset; ，提高移动速度。击退抗性^red;降低50^reset;%，防御^red;降低35点^reset;。\n\n^gray;玻璃大炮^reset;：伤害^green;提升100%^reset;，但防御^red;降低90%^reset;\n\n^green;免疫接种^reset;：提供对大多数负面状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;。攻击与防御^red;降低10%^reset;。\n\n^white;主宰^reset;：你获得击退^cyan;免疫^reset;，并^green;增加50点^reset;防御，但移动速度^red;降低33%^reset;。\n\n^green;毒云^reset;：每3秒，你所在位置会释放一片持续5秒的^green;毒云^reset;，造成30点穿透伤害。每次释放时，你^red;自身会受到5点穿透伤害^reset;。饥饿速率^red;增加20%^reset;。\n\n^#B200FF;实验#322^reset;：每10秒随机施加持续15至25秒的^green;正面^reset;或^red;负面^reset;状态效果。\n\n^red;巨怪血统^reset;：在5秒内^green;恢复所受伤害的40%^reset;，代价是生命值^red;降低20%^reset;且能量重充能时间^red;延长50%^reset;。\n\n^green;劲量^reset;：能量上限^green;提高50%^reset;，能量恢复速度^green;提升33%^reset;。饥饿速率^red;提高25%^reset;。能量重充能时间^red;延长100%^reset;。\n\n^yellow;垂体^reset;：能量回复速度^green;提升33%^reset;，能量上限^red;降低50点^reset;。此外，能量越低移动速度越快（剩余能量为35%时最高可^green;提升67%^reset;移速）。受到伤害会短暂^red;中断^reset;能量回复，并^red;消耗相当于伤害值150%的能量^reset;。\n\n^green;蜂群思维^reset;：生命值高于10%时，每0.5秒消耗当前生命值的^red;1.25%^reset;，向中等范围内、射程清晰的最近敌人^green;发射投射物^reset;（优先选择近期未被命中的目标）；命中时造成相当于自身最大生命值^green;2.5%^reset;的基础伤害（^orange;受攻击倍率影响^reset;），并施加^red;蜂蜇^reset;效果。\n\n^cyan;线粒体^reset;：每0.15秒消耗^red;2^reset;点能量以恢复^green;1^reset;点生命值。能量仅在生命值全满时才会恢复。\n\n^#7A7D81;暗影排斥^reset;：提升^green;50%^reset;的暗影抗性，并获得对暗影状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;，但会降低其他抗性（物理抗性除外）的整体效果^red;33%^reset;。\n\n^#C5B00A;辐射排斥^reset;：提升^green;50%^reset;的辐射抗性，并获得对辐射状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;，但会降低其他抗性（物理抗性除外）的整体效果^red;33%^reset;。\n\n^#69B115;毒素排斥^reset;：提升^green;50%^reset;的毒素抗性，并获得对毒素状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;，但会降低其他抗性（物理抗性除外）的整体效果^red;33%^reset;。\n\n^#A1F1FE;寒气排斥^reset;：提升^green;50%^reset;的寒气抗性，并获得对寒气状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;，但会降低其他抗性（物理抗性除外）的整体效果^red;33%^reset;。\n\n^#E99400;火炎排斥^reset;：提升^green;50%^reset;的火炎抗性，并获得对火炎状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;，但会降低其他抗性（物理抗性除外）的整体效果^red;33%^reset;。\n\n^#9711E4;电系排斥^reset;：提升^green;50%^reset;的电系抗性，并获得对电系状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;，但会降低其他抗性（物理抗性除外）的整体效果^red;33%^reset;。\n\n^#6062EB;射线排斥^reset;：提升^green;50%^reset;的射线抗性，并获得对射线状态效果的^cyan;免疫^reset;，但会降低其他抗性（物理抗性除外）的整体效果^red;33%^reset;。"
